# Web3Forms - Contact Form (takes 30 seconds to set up)
#
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com/
# 2. Enter your email address and click "Create Access Key"
# 3. Check your inbox and copy the access key
# 4. Rename this file to .env and paste the key below
# 5. Restart the dev server — done!

VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
